cs\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-01-11\nValid as Of:\",1134\n346,\"--- Record 1061 ---\nComponent: Data Space Integration\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: New Operator \"\"Exists\"\" for Company Policies\nDescription: When you create rules for company policies, you can now use the operator exists in combination with the attribute contract reference. Create a new rule, select the attribute contract reference, then select exists. The value of the rule is left empty on purpose to define that the company policy should check if any contract reference exists in the provider's offer.  See Create and Edit Company Policies.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-04-10\nValid as Of: 2025-04-10\nVersion: 2502\n\n--- Record 1062 ---\nComponent: Data Space Integration\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Software Version Update\nDescription: The following are the latest versions in Data Space Integration:      Data Space Integration: 1.7.*      Increment: 2502      Tractus-X Eclipse Dataspace Connector: 0.7.6      FOSS Eclipse Dataspace Components: 0.7.2      See also the Release Notes of Catena-X. \nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-04-10\nValid as Of: 2025-04-10\nVersion: 2502\n\n--- Record 1063 ---\nComponent: Mobile Services\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Access: BTP Cockpit & Dev Space Manager\nDescription: (Version 2503) To simplify navigation to your SAP BTP Cockpit and Dev Space Manager, we have added direct links in the Mobile Services cockpit.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-04-10\nValid as Of: 2025-04-10\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 1064 ---\nComponent: Mobile Services\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Full Initial Download from Offline